# Hardened mode service posture — full Tor isolation plus NetworkManager
# (wireguard/openvpn control and MAC randomization rely on nmcli).
# dnsmasq forwards local DNS to Tor's DNSPort (9053) and is what resolv.conf
# points at, keeping application queries off the clearnet.
# nftables is deliberately NOT listed: toggling it would `nft flush
# ruleset` and destroy the hardened.nft table. Firewall is owned by
# _apply_firewall() only.
+ NetworkManager
+ tor@default
+ dnsmasq